It has to be fine.

504
00:43:45,220 --> 00:43:47,384
Yeah...

505
00:43:47,384 --> 00:43:50,549
It'll be okay. It has to be okay.

506
00:43:52,683 --> 00:43:54,616
It'll be okay, right?

507
00:43:55,783 --> 00:43:58,260
It'll be okay.

508
00:43:58,260 --> 00:44:01,716
